One picture button. Use it inside [[Template:Tiles]]. The whole tile is clickable.

<pre>
{{Tile|Weapons}}
{{Tile|Weapons|image=Cinder tile weapons.png}}
{{Tile|Class/samurai|label=Samurai|image=Samurai.png|text=Katanas and staffs}}
{{Tile|Building Blocks|image=Thatch.png|pixel=yes}}
</pre>

* First value: the page the tile opens.
* <code>label</code>: the text under the picture (the page name if left out).
* <code>image</code>: an uploaded file name, without <code>File:</code>. Without one, the tile shows the label's first letter.
* <code>text</code>: an optional short line under the label.
* <code>pixel=yes</code>: keeps small Minecraft icons sharp when they are enlarged. Leave it off for painted art.

